entries[405076] = { ["name"] = "Shadowflame Wreathe", ["text"] = "10 sec cast\nTools: Runed Enchanting Rod\nReagents:\nVibrant Shard (4), Resonant Crystal (4), Shadowflame Essence , Awakened Fire (4)\nOptional Reagents:\nIllustrious Insight (#93)\nPermanently enchants a weapon to erupt with Shadowflame, causing your damaging spells and abilities to sometimes inflict 2364 Shadowflame damage to your target over 12 sec while instantly inflicting 197 Shadowflame damage to yourself. Cannot be applied to items lower than level 10.\nDrop:\nMagmorax\nZone:\nAberrus, the Shadowed Crucible\nRecipe:\nPurchasable on the Auction House\n\nEnchant Weapon - Shadowflame Wreathe\n\nUse: Permanently enchants a weapon to erupt with Shadowflame, causing your damaging spells and abilities to sometimes inflict 2364 Shadowflame damage to your target over 12 sec while instantly inflicting 197 Shadowflame damage to yourself. Cannot be applied to items lower than level 10.\n60" }
