entries[405120] = { ["name"] = "Metamorphic Serevite Deposit", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nSerevite is the most common ore found across the Dragon Isles. Though it is often found in mountainous regions, it is also revealed around flowing bodies of water.\n\nOre deposits in an active metamorphic state can only be found in Zaralek Cavern.\n\nGain the following effect when mining:\n\nZaralek Glowdust :\nCovers you in glowing dust that is perfect to assist in the propagation of spores. Lasts 2 min." }
entries[405121] = { ["name"] = "Metamorphic Draconium Deposit", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nDraconium Deposits are a rare find upon the Dragon Isles, but they are more often spotted in rugged or hard to reach locations.\n\nOre deposits in an active metamorphic state can only be found in Zaralek Cavern.\n\nGain the following effect when mining:\n\nZaralek Glowdust :\nCovers you in glowing dust that is perfect to assist in the propagation of spores. Lasts 2 min." }
entries[405122] = { ["name"] = "Crustaceous Hex" }
entries[405123] = { ["name"] = "Lambent Hochenblume", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nHochenblume is the most common herb found across the Dragon Isles. It can be found in practically any terrain, growing wherever possible.\n\nLambent herbs can only be found in Zaralek Cavern.\n\nGain the following effect when gathering:\n\nZaralek Glowbur :\nCovers you in radiant spores that are eager to propagate. Lasts 2 min." }
entries[405124] = { ["name"] = "Lambent Bubble Poppy", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nBubble Poppy is a delicate herb that grows in the aquatic locales of the Dragon Isles. It grows along the rivers, coasts, and inside damp caves.\n\nDespite its unique appearance, the Bubble Poppy flower isn't particularly useful. Rather, the watery, fungal orb that forms at its base is where the real value lies.\n\nLambent herbs can only be found in Zaralek Cavern.\n\nGain the following effect when gathering:\n\nZaralek Glowbur :\nCovers you in radiant spores that are eager to propagate. Lasts 2 min." }
entries[405125] = { ["name"] = "Jet Stream", ["text"] = "100 yd range\nInstant\nThe caster channels high-pressure waves in front and behind them, inflicting 12 Frost damage to enemies and knocking them back.\n\nThe waves rotate around the caster while channeling." }
entries[405126] = { ["name"] = "Lambent Saxifrage", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nSaxifrage is a sturdy herb that can grow in a multitude of places. While generally found in rugged locations like mountains or on cliffs, it can also be found upon the open plains or scarcely within volcanic regions.\n\nLambent herbs can only be found in Zaralek Cavern.\n\nGain the following effect when gathering:\n\nZaralek Glowbur :\nCovers you in radiant spores that are eager to propagate. Lasts 2 min." }
entries[405127] = { ["name"] = "Lambent Writhebark", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nWrithebark is a verdant herb found on the Dragon Isles. It can be found where there is an abundance of trees or foliage.\n\nLambent herbs can only be found in Zaralek Cavern.\n\nGain the following effect when gathering:\n\nZaralek Glowbur :\nCovers you in radiant spores that are eager to propagate. Lasts 2 min." }
